---
title: Cornish Hen in Port Wine and Fig Preserves
cookTime: 5 hr
rating: 4
description: Easy slow cooker recipe, fall-apart meat. The other recipe for "Roasted Cornish Game Hens with Cranberry-Port Sauce" recipe is better flavor.
source: https://www.epicurious.com/recipes/food/views/cornish-hen-in-port-wine-and-fig-preserves-51200420
tags: Alcohol, Poultry, Slow Cooker
---

Coat the inside of a #slow cooker{} with cooking spray.

Sprinkle the @Cornish game hen{2%lb} liberally with @salt and @pepper.
Insert @fresh rosemary{2%sprigs} into cavity.
Transfer hen to the slow cooker.

Stir together the @fig preserves{1/4%cup} and @port wine{1/4%cup} in a small bowl and pour over hen.

Cover and cook on High for ~{5%hours}.

Taste, and season again with salt and pepper.
Serve sauce over hen.
